messages:  ["Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 720137 and 303548? Please reason step by step.\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 720137 and 303548, we can follow these steps:\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, making sure the digits in the same place value are in the same column.\n2. Start adding from the rightmost digit (the units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of any column is 10 or more, carry over the tens digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n</think>\n<answer>\nLet's add the numbers step by step:\n```\n  720137\n+ 303548\n---------\n```\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):\n7 + 8 = 15. Write down 5 and carry over 1.\n```\n  720137\n+ 303548\n---------\n      5\n```\nNext column (tens place):\n3 + 4 + 1 (carried over) = 8. Write down 8.\n```\n  720137\n+ 303548\n---------\n     85\n```\nNext column (hundreds place):\n1 + 5 = 6. Write down 6.\n```\n  720137\n+ 303548\n---------\n    685\n```\nNext column (thousands place):\n0 + 3 = 3. Write down 3.\n```\n  720137\n+ 303548\n---------\n   3685\n```\nNext column (ten thousands place):\n2 + 0 = 2. Write down 2.\n```\n  720137\n+ 303548\n---------\n  23685\n```\nNext column (hundred thousands place):\n7 + 3 = 10. Write down 0 and carry over 1.\n```\n  720137\n+ 303548\n---------\n 123685\n```\nSo, the sum of 720137 and 303548 is 123685.\n</answer>\n"]
