messages:  ["Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 943652 and 340758? Please reason step by step.\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 943652 and 340758, we can follow these steps:\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, making sure the digits in the same place value are in the same column.\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (the units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum in any column is 10 or more, carry over the tens digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n</think>\n<answer>\nLet's perform the addition step by step:\n```\n  943652\n+ 340758\n---------\n```\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):\n2 + 8 = 10. Write down 0 and carry over 1.\n```\n  943652\n+ 340758\n---------\n      0\n```\nNext column (tens place):\n5 + 5 + 1 (carried over) = 11. Write down 1 and carry over 1.\n```\n  943652\n+ 340758\n---------\n      1\n```\nNext column (hundreds place):\n6 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 14. Write down 4 and carry over 1.\n```\n  943652\n+ 340758\n---------\n      4\n```\nNext column (thousands place):\n3 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 4.\n```\n  943652\n+ 340758\n---------\n     44\n```\nNext column (ten thousands place):\n4 + 4 = 8.\n```\n  943652\n+ 340758\n---------\n    844\n```\nNext column (hundred thousands place):\n9 + 3 = 12. Write down 2 and carry over 1.\n```\n  943652\n+ 340758\n---------\n  1284\n```\nFinally, the leftmost column (millions place):\n1 + 0 = 1.\n```\n  943652\n+ 340758\n---------\n 1284400\n```\nSo, the sum of 943652 and 340758 is 1284400.\n</answer>\n"]
